Installing Lughnasadh
=====================

Requirements
------------
* A C++20 compiler (GCC 10+, Clang 12+, or MSVC recent)
* CMake 3.16 or newer
* pthread (Unix; not needed for Android Bionic builds)

Build (release)
---------------
    cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    cmake --build build -j

Binary: build/lughnasadh

Optional install
----------------
    cmake --install build --prefix /usr/local

Smoke (UCI)
-----------
    printf 'uci\nisready\nposition startpos\ngo depth 6\nquit\n' | ./build/lughnasadh

Perft check (startpos depth 5 = 4865609)
----------------------------------------
    printf 'position startpos\ngo perft 5\nquit\n' | ./build/lughnasadh

Android packaging notes: see android/README.md
